{"3687100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tomb of Chacal", "steam_appid": 3687100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomb of Chacal is a stealth-based horror game set in an long-forgotten tomb. You are an archeologist who has stumbled into this place almost by accident and are now in a fight for your very survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/619667c4ca48f77df2b243e633045799.poster.avif?t=1786010540\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/619667c4ca48f77df2b243e633045799.webm?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/619667c4ca48f77df2b243e633045799.mp4?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead do not want to be disturbed and there are ancient creatures called &quot;Guardians&quot; that have been sworn to protect this place from all who would trespass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES AND EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/e2a398a9adb38b13246a196f8b9953ec.poster.avif?t=1786010540\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/e2a398a9adb38b13246a196f8b9953ec.webm?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/e2a398a9adb38b13246a196f8b9953ec.mp4?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with different contraptions to make your way through the labyrinth. Collect artifacts to return to the museum - if you can make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT BE SEEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/0c04cab8d21c211cd039043192baab78.poster.avif?t=1786010540\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/0c04cab8d21c211cd039043192baab78.webm?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/0c04cab8d21c211cd039043192baab78.mp4?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guardians here are not omniscient - you will have to use your wits to survive. Find hiding spots to confuse them, or just run away if all else fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomb of Chacal is a stealth-based horror game set in an long-forgotten tomb. You are an archeologist who has stumbled into this place almost by accident and are now in a fight for your very survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/619667c4ca48f77df2b243e633045799.poster.avif?t=1786010540\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/619667c4ca48f77df2b243e633045799.webm?t=1786010540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/